# Project Rename: QGalleryX

This plan outlines the steps to rename the project from "antigravity" and "Samsung Gallery Clone" to its new official name: **QGalleryX**.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **GitHub Repository Rename**: You will need to manually rename the repository on GitHub settings to `QGalleryX`. This will change the URL to `https://github.com/[username]/QGalleryX`.
> I will update the internal links in the documentation, but you must perform the GitHub action yourself.

> [!WARNING]
> **Local Directory Name**: If you rename your local folder from `d:\Dev\antigravity` to `d:\Dev\QGalleryX`, you will need to re-open the workspace in your IDE and potentially reconfigure CMake.

## Proposed Changes

### Documentation & Branding

#### [MODIFY] [README.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/README.md)
*   Update title to `# QGalleryX`.
*   Replace all "Samsung Gallery Clone" and "antigravity" references with "QGalleryX".
*   Update GitHub URLs and badges.

#### [MODIFY] [RELEASE_NOTES.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/RELEASE_NOTES.md)
*   Standardize branding to QGalleryX.

#### [MODIFY] [docs/README.md](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/docs/README.md)
*   Update documentation overview with the new name.

#### [MODIFY] All files in `docs/` and `docs/resume/`
*   Perform a global find-and-replace for branding consistency.

---

### Build System & Binaries

#### [MODIFY] [CMakeLists.txt](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/CMakeLists.txt)
*   Update `project(SamsungGallery)` to `project(QGalleryX)`.
*   Update executable targets to `QGalleryX` and `QGalleryX-Bench`.

#### [MODIFY] [build.ps1](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/build.ps1)
*   Update `$ExeName = "QGalleryX.exe"`.
*   Update display strings and logs.

#### [MODIFY] [deploy.ps1](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/deploy.ps1)
*   Update deployment paths and executable names.

---

### UI & Source Code

#### [MODIFY] [resources/qml/Main.qml](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/resources/qml/Main.qml) (and others)
*   Update Window titles to "QGalleryX".

#### [MODIFY] [src/main.cpp](file:///d:/Dev/antigravity/src/main.cpp)
*   Update `QCoreApplication::setApplicationName("QGalleryX")`.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1.  Run `.\build.ps1` to ensure the new `QGalleryX.exe` builds successfully.
2.  Run `.\test_scrollbench\build.ps1` to ensure `QGalleryX-Bench.exe` builds successfully.
3.  Execute the newly built binaries and verify they start without errors.

### Manual Verification
1.  Check the window title of the application to ensure it says "QGalleryX".
2.  Verify that the `README.md` links are correctly pointing to the new (intended) GitHub URL.
3.  Check the "About" or "Diagnostics" sections (if any) for correct branding.
